{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "58", "x": 0.9028085993420154, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.030934649261620407, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "at them or touch them. That's a no-no. When the robo-umpires came, however, the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.8266396585180859, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "arguments stopped.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.2091233009180187, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "During the first robo-umpire season, players complained about some strange", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1896453759080105, "w": 0.826256112665902, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "calls. In response, MLB decided to tweak the dimensions of the zone, and the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.21797572598214812, "w": 0.8259902654606861, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "following year the consensus was that ABS is profoundly consistent. MLB says", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.24630607605628574, "w": 0.8265526148323056, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the device is near-perfect, precise to within fractions of an inch. \"It'll reduce", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2746735439806541, "w": 0.8262708762592499, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "controversy in the game, and be good for the game,\" says Rob Manfred, who is", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3030039694975767, "w": 0.8259901629357324, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Commissioner for MLB. But the question is whether controversy is worth reducing,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.33133430071101805, "w": 0.8267519233425021, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "or whether it is the sign of a human hand.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3596646507851557, "w": 0.42141249551581483, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "A human, at least, yells back. When I spoke with Frank Viola, a coach for a North", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.39778456980788796, "w": 0.8258812814347917, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Carolina team, he said that ABS works as designed, but that it was also", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4261149576034181, "w": 0.8260116931760313, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "unforgiving and pedantic, almost legalistic. \"Manfred is a lawyer,\" Viola noted.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4544453076775557, "w": 0.8266189484774172, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Some pitchers have complained that, compared with a human's, the robot's strike", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.48280040298518045, "w": 0.8263600729690601, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "zone seems too precise. Viola was once a major-league player himself. When he", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5111307907807106, "w": 0.8265316997417294, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "was pitching, he explained, umpires rewarded skill. \"Throw it where you aimed,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5394611408548482, "w": 0.8267084527620889, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and it would be a strike, even if it was an inch or two outside. There was a dialogue", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5677915286503784, "w": 0.8262296612278204, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "between pitcher and umpire.\"", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5961219164459085, "w": 0.3046685352864747, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "The executive tasked with running the experiment for MLB is Morgan Sword,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6343901559839935, "w": 0.8260555738562598, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "who's in charge of baseball operations. According to Sword, ABS was part of a", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6627576239083618, "w": 0.8266039798341618, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "larger project to make baseball more exciting since executives are terrified of", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6909396534671467, "w": 0.8259464873054115, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "losing younger fans, as has been the case with horse racing and boxing. He", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7192700035412843, "w": 0.8260771040965588, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "explains how they began the process by asking fans what version of baseball they", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.747600429058207, "w": 0.8268583442445515, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "found most exciting. The results showed that everyone wanted more action: more", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7759307791323447, "w": 0.8261206772019258, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "hits, more defense, more baserunning. This type of baseball essentially hasn't", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8042611292064822, "w": 0.826011898225939, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "existed since the 1960s, when the hundred-mile-an-hour fastball, which is difficult", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8325914792806198, "w": 0.8264815650393188, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to hit and control, entered the game. It flattened the game into strikeouts, walks,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8609465745882446, "w": 0.8260437834865723, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and home runs-a type of play lacking much action.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8892770001051672, "w": 0.5149420123987528, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}